{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51515","headline":"过平泉庄（李朱厓〖德裕〗平泉庄，佳景可爱。洛中士人诧於「汪」〖江〗遵，遵有诗曰：） · 汪遵","name":"过平泉庄（李朱厓〖德裕〗平泉庄，佳景可爱。洛中士人诧於「汪」〖江〗遵，遵有诗曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平泉风景好高眠，水色风光满目前。\n刚欲平他不平事，至今惆怅满南迁。\n（今按：此一首与《唐诗纪事》及《全唐诗》字句多不同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汪遵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}